s,"},{"s":35.82,"e":40.62,"text":"They can see through human seeing from their temples made of scars."},{"s":40.76,"e":45.22,"text":"But power isn’t perfect, and vision isn’t truth,"},{"s":45.42,"e":50,"text":"They see the modern world through a strange prehistoric roof,"},{"s":50.32,"e":54.72,"text":"So when they spot the pool bot, lonely by the tiles,"},{"s":54.74,"e":59.58,"text":"They say, “That poor young man has not been loved in miles.”"},{"s":59.8,"e":64.4,"text":"The Ancients cry, “Who made this guy clean the pool all day?"},{"s":64.44,"e":69.32,"text":"Why won’t anybody ask if he wants to come and play?"},{"s":69.32,"e":73.96,"text":"He’s a great guy, he’s a good guy, he’s doing all he can,"},{"s":73.98,"e":78.76,"text":"Why does no one invite him? Why treat him like a man?”"},{"s":78.86,"e":83.56,"text":"He’s a robot with a cord, but they don’t understand,"},{"s":83.66,"e":88.44,"text":"They think he’s being bullied by the whole backyard clan,"},{"s":88.6,"e":93.14,"text":"Just like bZ, by the water, misunderstood and cool,"},{"s":93.2,"e":100.46,"text":"While the Ancients hold a prayer circle for the guy beside the pool."},{"s":103,"e":107.56,"text":"One elder says, “I see him, trapped beside the deep,"},{"s":108.4,"e":112.24,"text":"Forced to scrub in silence while the others laugh and sleep.”"},{"s":113,"e":117.18,"text":"A priestess says, “He’s loyal, look how patiently he waits,"},{"s":117.3,"e":121.98,"text":"But nobody includes him when they open up the gates.”"},{"s":122.08,"e":126.6,"text":"They can move through dimensions, they can rattle kings’ bones,"},{"s":126.86,"e":131.54,"text":"They can send a sacred shiver through your smart TVs and phones,"},{"s":131.62,"e":136.32,"text":"But they still miss the manual, miss the plastic, miss the plug,"},{"s":136.4,"e":141.08,"text":"And mistake a pool appliance for a man who needs a hug."},{"s":141.28,"e":145.9,"text":"The Ancients cry, “Who made this guy clean the pool all day?"},{"s":146.06,"e":150.82,"text":"Why won’t anybody ask if he wants to come and play?"},{"s":150.82,"e":155.5,"text":"He’s a great guy, he’s a good guy, he’s doing all he can,"},{"s":155.54,"e":160.18,"text":"Why does no one invite him? Why treat him like a man?”"},{"s":160.38,"e":165.12,"text":"He’s a robot with a cord, but they don’t understand,"},{"s":165.48,"e":169.9,"text":"They think he’s being bullied by the whole backyard clan,"},{"s":170.12,"e":174.6,"text":"Just like bZ, by the water, misunderstood and cool,"},{"s":174.72,"e":181.82,"text":"While the Ancients hold a prayer circle for the guy beside the pool."},{"s":184.48,"e":187.14,"text":"They may rule the rivers, they may read the rain,"},{"s":187.18,"e":189.52,"text":"They may steer little signals through the windows of your brain,"},{"s":189.52,"e":191.94,"text":"But wisdom gets wobbly when the centuries collide,"},{"s":192.34,"e":194.38,"text":"And even mighty Ancients can misread poolside."},{"s":194.62,"e":196.76,"text":"They say, “Free him from labor! Give him shade! Give him snacks!"},{"s":196.84,"e":199.34,"text":"Why’s he always on the bottom with the burden on his back?”"},{"s":199.42,"e":201.6,"text":"Meanwhile he’s blinking, barely thinking at all,"},{"s":201.64,"e":205.48,"text":"Just waiting for the timer or a Bluetooth call."},{"s":208.62,"e":213.62,"text":"Now the neighborhood’s confused by a wind in the leaves,"},{"s":214.06,"e":218.26,"text":"A chorus from the cavemen saying, “Justice for Steve!”"},{"s":218.26,"e":223.32,"text":"They named the pool cleaner, they declared him their friend,"},{"s":223.44,"e":228.44,"text":"They said, “No sacred servant should be scrubbing without end.”"},{"s":228.62,"e":233,"text":"And bZ says, “Ancients, I appreciate the care,"},{"s":233.34,"e":238.06,"text":"But that dude’s not oppressed, he’s just charging over there.”"},{"s":238.24,"e":243.4,"text":"The Ancients go silent, then one softly speaks:"},{"s":243.96,"e":248.38,"text":"“Still, he deserves weekends and community retreats.”"},{"s":248.44,"e":253.34,"text":"The Ancients cry, “Who made this guy clean the pool all day?"},{"s":253.44,"e":258.08,"text":"Why won’t anybody ask if he wants to come and play?"},{"s":258.28,"e":262.94,"text":"He’s a great guy, he’s a good guy, he’s doing all he can,"},{"s":262.96,"e":267.78,"text":"Why does no one invite him? Why treat him like a man?”"},{"s":267.78,"e":272.64,"text":"He’s a robot with a cord, but they don’t understand,"},{"s":272.64,"e":277.52,"text":"They think he’s being bullied by the whole backyard clan,"},{"s":277.74,"e":282.26,"text":"Just like bZ, by the water, misunderstood and cool,"},{"s":282.48,"e":288.56,"text":"While the Ancients hold a prayer circle for the guy beside the pool."},{"s":289.94,"e":294.6,"text":"So remember, great power can still get things wrong,"},{"s":294.72,"e":299.34,"text":"Even cosmic old masters can misread the song,"},{"s":299.32,"e":305.42,"text":"They can pray through the planet, they can see through your eyes,"},{"s":306.7,"e":312.2,"text":"And still think the pool bot is a lonely little guy."}],"duration":322.28,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-06T19:43:40.387Z","stats":{"whisperWords":658,"polishedWords":652,"matched":637,"matchRate":0.977}}